\fill (0,4.4) circle (2.5pt);
\fill (4.4,0) circle (2.5pt);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The increasing curve shown is neither direct nor inverse variation: it is not straight and it passes through the origin. Increasing alone does not rule out inverse variation with a negative constant.

